  "body": "*** Settle Before Christmas and Enjoy $5,000 Worth of FREE Home Appliances! ***\r\n\r\nCrafted to the highest standard, finished with a striking Queenstown-inspired stone facade, these brand-new, free-standing freehold home are designed with style, comfort and convenience in mind.\r\n\r\nStep inside and you'll immediately appreciate a layout that is both practical and inviting. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas connect seamlessly, with contemporary finishes throughout. Ranch sliders open to the deck, creating an easy indoor-outdoor flow that's well suited to entertaining or simply enjoying time at home.\r\n\r\nThe modern kitchen combines quality appliances, generous storage and a clean, contemporary design, making it a functional and attractive space at the heart of the home.\r\n\r\nUpstairs are three bedrooms, including a master with ensuite, along with a dedicated study nook that provides a convenient space for working from home or study. An internal-access garage and road frontage add further everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nConveniently located, the home is just a short drive from Half Moon Bay Marina and only minutes from Highland Park's supermarkets, cafes, restaurants and everyday amenities. Well-regarded local schools, public transport and nearby parks further enhance the appeal of this location.\r\n\r\nBrand new, standalone and on a freehold title, this is an excellent opportunity for buyers seeking a contemporary home in the heart of Half Moon Bay. The vendor welcomes genuine enquiry.\r\n\r\n*** CCC and Ttile both are issued, can be settled at any time ! ***",
